Source URL: https://time.com/5610878/2018-2019-flu-season/

### How many flu-associated deaths did the CDC estimate occurred during the 2019–2020 flu season in the United States?
Answer: According to the CDC, there were an estimated **24,000–62,000 flu-associated deaths** during the 2019–2020 flu season in the United States, not 75,000 as the claim suggests. The source states: "Preliminary data suggests there were an estimated 24,000-62,000 flu deaths for the 2019-20 influenza season."

Source URL: https://www.contagionlive.com/view/how-deadly-was-the-2019-2020-flu-season

